# Living Design Doc + Changelog Rule

Maintain two files as we build the game:
- `DESIGN.md`: concise living design document
- `CHANGELOG.md`: concise list of notable changes

## When to update
- After any **feature addition**, **rule change**, **mechanic rename**, or **architecture decision**.
- If a change affects player experience, controls, camera, rendering (3D voxels/2D sprites), squads/units, or win conditions.

## `DESIGN.md` constraints
- Keep it **short** (prefer < ~150 lines).
- Prefer **bullets**, not essays.
- Record **decisions and rules**, not brainstorming.
- If a section grows, **summarize** and move detail into a new doc under `docs/` (create it only when necessary).

## `CHANGELOG.md` constraints
- Keep it **short** and **chronological**.
- One bullet per change; focus on **player-visible** changes and major milestones.
- Always add new items under **Unreleased** unless a release is explicitly created.

